A comparative table is essential to preempt objections. The key differentiator of DSP-AI is that it is the only framework to combine (1) an explicit formalism of capability emergence, (2) a constrained, policy-driven approach to structural change, and (3) a solution method with theoretical grounding in constrained optimization.

